red><option value="">နေရာရွေးပါ</option><% r.places.forEach(place=>{ %><option value="<%= place.id %>" <%= String(v.place_id)===String(place.id)?'selected':'' %>><%= place.name.toLowerCase()==='warehouse'?'Main Warehouse':place.name %></option><% }); %></select></div><div><label for="oil-fixed"><%= r.direction==='IN'?'To':'From' %></label><input id="oil-fixed" value="Main Warehouse" readonly></div><% } %><section class="oil-wide oil-inline-items"><div class="oil-inline-heading"><h3>Items <span id="oil-item-count">0</span></h3><div class="oil-import-tools"><button type="button" id="oil-import-excel">Import Excel</button><button type="button" id="oil-add-item">+ Add Item</button><input type="file" id="oil-import-file" accept=".xlsx" hidden></div></div><p class="oil-note">Item Code ကို Scan ဖတ်ပါ / ရိုက်ပါ။ Qty နှင့် Remark ကို သက်ဆိုင်ရာ row တွင် ဖြည့်ပါ။</p><div class="oil-table-wrap"><table class="oil-table oil-entry-table"><thead><tr><th>Item Code</th><th>Item Name</th><th>Category</th><th>Balance · g</th><th>Qty · g</th><th>Remark</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody id="oil-items"><% for(const line of (Array.isArray(v.items)?v.items:[])){ %><tr class="oil-restored-item"><td><input type="hidden" data-saved="code" value="<%= line.code||'' %>"></td><td></td><td></td><td><input type="hidden" data-saved="qty" value="<%= line.qty||'' %>"></td><td><input type="hidden" data-saved="remark" value="<%= line.remark||'' %>"></td></tr><% } %></tbody></table></div><p id="oil-entry-message" class="oil-note" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></section></div><div class="oil-form-footer"><span>Adjustment ရွေးထားပါက <%= user.role==='warehouse_supervisor'?'Accountant':'Supervisor → Accountant' %> အတည်ပြုပြီးမှ Balance ထဲ ပေါင်းမည်။ အခြား Category များကို ချက်ချင်းစာရင်းသွင်းမည်။</span><button id="oil-save" type="submit" disabled><%= r.direction==='IN'?'Save Stock In':'Save Stock Out' %></button></div><p class="oil-import-download"><a href="/inventory/raw-oil/import-template.xlsx">* Import Excel format ကို ဒီ link မှာ download လုပ်နိုင်ပါသည် *</a></p></form>
